  "compatibility_note": "Adapted for **nightly** from the released **0.6 workflow catalog**. H3 settings and sockets are validated against nightly.",
  "setup_steps": "1. Install ComfyUI-MAINodes v1.1.3 or newer and select your H3 model, text encoder and VAEs.\n2. In Checkpoint Manager choose the Original branch to repair. No Plan or source render is required.\n3. Set a NEW De-Rope profile and the Adapter scene range. Source resolution is preserved.\n4. Leave manual ranges blank for automatic repair; use a single scene for a targeted range.\n5. Review the budget and final-frame reports. Full recovered latents are saved for later upscaling."
